sequenceDiagram
 actor Student
 actor Instructor
 participant API
 participant SQLite
 Student->>Instructor: Show rotating membership QR
 Instructor->>API: Scan token with selected class ID
 API->>API: Check instructor, class time and QR signature
 API->>SQLite: BEGIN IMMEDIATE and require active plan AND booking
 alt Valid subscription and booking
 API->>SQLite: Mark checked_in, notify and audit; COMMIT
 API-->>Instructor: Attendance recorded
 else Invalid subscription or no confirmed booking
 API-->>Instructor: Error; attendance unchanged
 end
